                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Just when I thought this bill couldn\u2019t get any worse \u2014 Republicans now want to cut almost $1 trillion from Medicaid. \n\nThe latest version of their budget bill will kick millions off their health care, take food assistance and good-paying jobs from hardworking Americans and increase the deficit by trillions of dollars.",
