                "text": "It\u2019s been one week since Republicans passed their budget that they swore \u201cwouldn\u2019t touch Medicaid.\u201d They lied.\n\nNow, hundreds of thousands of Minnesotans are at risk of losing their health insurance.\nhttps://t.co/MNzDwxJ7tQ",
