                "text": "Senate Republicans \u2013 including Senator Josh Hawley \u2013 passed the largest cut to Medicaid in American history by one vote.\n\nNow Senator Hawley is trying to save face \u2013 because he knows these cuts will make America\u2019s seniors, kids and veterans sicker and poorer.\n\nWe won\u2019t accept his buyer\u2019s remorse.",
