                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I\u2019m proud to support legislation to build on the progress we made through the Inflation Reduction Act - to make available the Medicare negotiated price of prescription drugs to EVERY American and hold Big Pharma accountable for price gouging Minnesotans.\n\nHere\u2019s what it will do:\n\u2705Extend IRA drug price negotiations to all Americans with private insurance\n\u2705Stop drug companies from raising prices faster than inflation\n\u2705More than double the number of prescription drugs selected for negotiation",
